# Host build output must never reach an image: `sharp` ships native binaries built
# for the host platform, and copying macOS ones into a Linux image breaks at runtime
# in a way that only shows up when a photo is analysed.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Nothing in these belongs in a runtime image.
docs
*.md
!README.md
